  "content": "\n\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><span style=\"color:#f00\">↭</span><span style=\"color:#f60\">Lucky Block Bedwars</span><span style=\"color:#f00\">↭</span><span style=\"color:#f00\">&nbsp;</span></span><br></strong></p>\n<hr>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:impact, sans-serif;color:#0f0;font-size:14px\"><strong>我的 YouTube 頻道：&nbsp;&nbsp;<span style=\"color:#00f\"><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCgqbU2FkSjeb2_p43P4MKhQ/featured\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"color:#f00\">點此處</span></a></span></strong></span><strong><br></strong></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"color:#00f\">模組：</span></strong></p>\n<p><span>1. 幸運方塊模組&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p>2. Loot ++ 模組&nbsp;<br>3. 自訂交易&nbsp;<br>4. WorldEdit&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"color:#00f\">安裝說明：</span><br></strong>1. 開啟 Windows 搜尋列並輸入 %appdata%&nbsp;<br>2. 進入 roaming 資料夾&nbsp;<br>3. 進入 .minecraft 資料夾&nbsp;<br>4. 解壓縮檔案，並將 Lucky Block Bedwars 1.8.-1.12.2 拖曳至 saves 資料夾中&nbsp;<br>5. 接著將推薦的模組拖曳至 mods 資料夾，並將附加元件拖曳至 addons/lucky blocks 資料夾中&nbsp;<br>6. 啟動遊戲並享受吧！&nbsp;<span>&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:'arial black', sans-serif;color:#f00\">已為 1.12+ 版本新增安裝說明，請參閱壓縮檔</span><br><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#0f0\">&copy;<a style=\"color:#0f0\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCgqbU2FkSjeb2_p43P4MKhQ\" rel=\"nofollow\">ThePikaChuP</a><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCgqbU2FkSjeb2_p43P4MKhQ\" rel=\"nofollow\">&nbsp;</a></span></strong><span style=\"font-size:18pt\"><span style=\"color:#f00\"><strong><span style=\"color:#ff0\"><span style=\"font-size:10pt\"><span style=\"color:#0ff\"><span style=\"font-size:8pt\"><span style=\"color:#000\"><br></span></span></span></span></span></strong></span></span></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<div>其他地圖／模組與捐款／功能請求</div>\n<div><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.paypal.com%252fcgi-bin%252fwebscr%253fcmd%253d_s-xclick%2526hosted_button_id%253dM9X4CVJ73PG3U\" rel=\"nofollow\">捐款／功能請求（點擊）<br><br></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/ThePikaChuP/projects\" rel=\"nofollow\">其他地圖／模組</a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/ThePikaChuP/projects\" rel=\"nofollow\">&nbsp;（點擊）</a></span></div>\n</div>",
